#. Description of the plugin
#: serhandemirel-core.php
msgid ""
"Content types, custom fields, the contact form, profile and structured data "
"for serhandemirel.com. Keeps projects, services, expertise cards, brand "
"logos and messages safe when the theme changes."
msgstr ""
"Contenttypes, aangepaste velden, het contactformulier, profiel en "
"gestructureerde data voor serhandemirel.com. Houdt projecten, diensten, "
"expertisekaarten, merklogo's en berichten veilig wanneer het thema "
"verandert."

